    details: "It includes methods such as **Shredding** (shredding into small fragments, highly recommended for SSDs and flash chips), **Pulping** (reduction to paper pulp for paper documents), **Pulverizing** (reduction of the chips to a very fine powder) and **Incineration** (complete thermal incineration at high temperatures).",
